        "original_id": "e62dd6f9-e6e2-5757-9b75-9cf4cd2fdc37",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: “Wicked Games”, “The Hills”\n- Films: “Southpaw”\n- People: Eminem, Antoine Fuqua, Kurt Sutter, Jake Gyllenhaal, Forest Whitaker, Rachel McAdams, The Weeknd\n- Roles: executive producer, director, writer, starring cast\n\nFacts:\n- “Southpaw” is a 2015 American sports drama film.\n- Antoine Fuqua directed “Southpaw”.\n- Kurt Sutter wrote “Southpaw”.\n- Jake Gyllenhaal, Forest Whitaker, and Rachel McAdams starred in “Southpaw”.\n- The song “Wicked Games” is featured on the soundtrack for the film “Southpaw”.\n- Eminem was the executive producer of the “Southpaw” soundtrack.\n- Eminem later produced a remix of The Weeknd’s song “The Hills” with The Weeknd.",
